om a <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field\">Poison Field</a>.<br/>\nYou can collect slime in any <a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">liquid container</a> by using the container on the corpse of any creature with green blood (most poison creatures), or you can fill it at a swamp.<br/>\n<b>Note:</b> be careful of a scam involving giving slime to a player in order to kill him.<br/>\nLooks the same as <a href=\"#/wiki/Wonder%20Glue\">Wonder Glue</a>, an <a href=\"#/wiki/Animal%20Cure\">Animal Cure</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Beaver%20Bait\">Flask with Beaver Bait</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Paint\">Flask with Paint</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Poison\">Flask of Poison</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Plant%20Poison\">Flask of Plant Poison</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandra\">Sandra</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">12 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div cl